---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config.js';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} collects, uses and protects personal information.`}>
  <section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Draft, for the club to review before launch.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>{SITE.name} ("the club") follows British Columbia's <em>Personal Information Protection Act</em> (PIPA).</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you send us a message through this website, we collect your name, email, optional phone number, your message, what you're interested in, and how you heard about us. We don't take registrations or payments online.</p>
      <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your question and tell you how to join</li>
        <li>To understand how people find the club (the "how did you hear" question)</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Who sees it</h2>
      <p>Only club instructors and administrators. We do not sell or share your information, except where the law requires it.</p>
      <h2>How we protect it</h2>
      <p>Messages are stored in a secure database. The admin area requires an individual login for each authorised club member.</p>
      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Up to two years after your last contact with us, unless you ask us to delete it sooner.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your information at any time. Contact our privacy contact at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>Photos</h2>
      <p>We only use photos of students on our website and social media with their consent, or a parent or guardian's consent for students under 18. You can withdraw consent at any time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
